     "q": "Climate change is a serious ______ to wildlife.",
     "hint": "amenaza",
     "a": "threat",
     "full": "Climate change is a serious threat to wildlife."
    },
    {
     "q": "He is said ______ be very rich.",
     "hint": "paráfrasis",
     "a": "to",
     "full": "He is said to be very rich."
